# Godot
godot/.godot/
godot/logs/
# Regenerated by `godot --headless --path godot --import`; the project has never tracked
# them and builds and runs headless without them. Not a ruling that they should never be
# tracked — Godot 4.4+ guidance is to commit .uid files so resource references survive
# renames. That is a project-wide convention change and belongs in its own commit.
*.uid
*.import

